</div>
</div>
<sup>2</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Steffanowski%20A"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id3"><span class="name western">Andrés Steffanowski</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id3">
<h3><span class="name western">Andrés Steffanowski</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>3</sup>University of Mannheim, Department of Psychology, Schloss Ehrenhof Ost (2.OG), Mannheim, Baden‐Württemberg, Germany, D‐68131</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Steffanowski%20A"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Andrés Steffanowski</span></a>
</div>
