<sup>3</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="van%20Marwijk%20H"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id4"><span class="name western">Harm van Marwijk</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id4">
<h3><span class="name western">Harm van Marwijk</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>4</sup>VU University Medical Center, Department of General Practice and Elderly Care Medicine, EMGO Institute for Health and Care Research, PO Box 7057, Amsterdam, Netherlands, 1007 MB</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="van%20Marwijk%20H"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Harm van Marwijk</span></a>
