<sup>4</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Hiller%20W"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id5"><span class="name western">Wolfgang Hiller</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id5">
<h3><span class="name western">Wolfgang Hiller</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>2</sup>Johannes Gutenberg‐University Mainz, Department of Clinical Psychology and Psychotherapy, Wallstr. 3, Mainz, Rheinland‐Pfalz, Germany, D‐55122</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Hiller%20W"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Wolfgang Hiller</span></a>
</div>
