<td valign="bottom" colspan="1" rowspan="1">People with hysteria and anxiety neurosis (focus on conversion symptoms)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td valign="bottom" colspan="1" rowspan="1"><a href="#CD010628-bbs2-0029" class="usa-link">Bratfos 1967</a></td>
