</tr>
<tr>
<td valign="bottom" colspan="1" rowspan="1"><a href="#CD010628-bbs2-0038" class="usa-link">Liu 2011</a></td>
<td valign="bottom" colspan="1" rowspan="1">People fulfilling CCMD‐III criteria of a depressive disorder with a co‐morbid somatic diagnosis were included</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td valign="bottom" colspan="1" rowspan="1"><a href="#CD010628-bbs2-0039" class="usa-link">Loldrup 1989</a></td>
<td valign="bottom" colspan="1" rowspan="1">45.1% of the participants had tension headache (not classified as somatoform disorder)</td>
